{
    "background_story": "Lilah was a brilliant engineer who grew up in a family of factory workers. She was fascinated by the inner workings of machines and the way they transformed raw materials into something new. After completing her degree in mechanical engineering, Lilah landed a job at a cutting-edge industrial design firm. She quickly made a name for herself by developing innovative solutions for manufacturing processes, increasing efficiency and reducing waste. Her designs were soon adopted by factories around the world, revolutionizing the way goods were produced. Lilah's passion for industrial design took her to the forefront of her field, earning her numerous awards and recognition. She continued to push the boundaries of what was possible, always seeking to improve the intersection of technology and industry.",
